@737 = ~Haste~
@738 = ~Haste (Alteration)
Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell accelerates the warlord. He gains a 75% increase in movement speed, +2 to speed factor, +1 to casting speed and armor class, and can make an additional attack per round. Haste does not stack with other haste effects, and does not negate a slow spell.~
@7389 = ~You are already under the effects of Haste~ ~You are already under the effects of Haste~
@7381 = ~Haste (Alteration)
Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 25 rounds
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell accelerates the warlord. He gains a 75% increase in movement speed, +2 to speed factor, +1 to casting speed and armor class, and can make an additional attack per round. Haste does not stack with other haste effects, and does not negate a slow spell.~
@7382 = ~Haste (Alteration)
Level: 3
