Saving Throw: none

This spell accelerates the recipient. He gains a 75% increase in movement speed, +2 to speed factor, +1 to casting speed and armor class, and can make an additional attack per round. Haste does not stack with other haste effects, and does not negate a slow spell.~
@73821 = ~Haste (Alteration)
Level: 3
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 25 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell accelerates the recipient. He gains a 75% increase in movement speed, +2 to speed factor, +1 to casting speed and armor class, and can make an additional attack per round. Haste does not stack with other haste effects, and does not negate a slow spell.

All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: +50% to movement speed, +1 to speed factor, 1 additional attack per round, for 17 rounds.~

@739 = ~Circle of Ice~
@7310 = ~Circle of Ice (Alteration)
Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: special
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 5-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

This spell suddenly chills the air around the warlord, gathering ice crystals into a frozen wave that spreads 5 meters outward. All creatures in the path of the wave are deeply chilled and suffer 1D4 +1 point of cold damage per level of the wizard (max. 10D4 +10) and become numb (-15% to movement speed, -1 to THAC0 and -2 to dexterity) for a round per level (max 1 turn).
Those who make a successful save vs. spell receive only half damage and avoid numbness.~
@73101 = ~Numb~
@73102 = ~Circle of Ice (Alteration)
Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: special
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 5-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

This spell suddenly chills the air around the warlord, gathering ice crystals into a frozen wave that spreads 5 meters outward. All creatures in the path of the wave are deeply chilled, suffer 10D4 +10 points of cold damage and become numb (-15% to movement speed, -1 to THAC0 and -2 to dexterity) for 1 turn.
Those who make a successful save vs. spell receive only half damage and avoid numbness.~

@7311 = ~Chain Lightning~
@7312 = ~Chain Lightning (Evocation)
Level: 3
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

When the warlord casts chain lightning, arcs of electrical energy burst from his fingertips. These brilliant arcs of lightning leap at all enemies near the caster, burning them with electrical damage. The lightning, when hitting a first target, splits to hit all the creatures within 9-meter radius. Caution should be exercised in using this spell, because lightning does not differentiate and equally strikes enemies and allies of the wizard. The lightning causes 1d6 points of damage for every level of the caster (maximum 10D6). If the target of the lightning saves against spells only half damage is inflicted.~
@73121 = ~Chain Lightning (Evocation)
Level: 3
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

When the warlord casts chain lightning, arcs of electrical energy burst from his fingertips. These brilliant arcs of lightning leap at all enemies near the caster, burning them with electrical damage. The lightning, when hitting a first target, splits to hit all the creatures within 9-meter radius. Caution should be exercised in using this spell, because lightning does not differentiate and equally strikes enemies and allies of the wizard. The lightning causes 10d6 points of damage. If the target of the lightning saves against spells only half damage is inflicted.~
@73122 = ~Chain Lightning (Evocation)
Level: 3
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 9-meter radius
Saving Throw: half

When the warlord casts chain lightning, arcs of electrical energy burst from his fingertips. These brilliant arcs of lightning leap at all enemies near the caster, burning them with electrical damage. The lightning, when hitting a first target, splits to hit all the creatures within 9-meter radius. The mage can freely lead lightning to hit his enemies only. The lightning causes 10d6 points of damage. If the target of the lightning saves against spells only half damage is inflicted.~

@7313 = ~Dispelling Field~
@7314 = ~Dispelling Field (Abjuration)
Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: special
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 10-meter radius
Saving Throw: none

This spell reproduces the effect of Dispel Magic, but extends dispelling to an area of 10-meter radius around the caster, dispelling any creature within the area. The chance of successful dispelling remains the same, always at least 1% chance of success/failure. Each creature is checked independently: dispelling may succeed against one and fail against another.~

@7315 = ~Ghost Hit~
@7316 = ~Ghost Hit (Evocation)
Level: 3
Range: 20 meters
Duration: instantaneous/special
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: special

The search for an unstoppable hit led the warlord to create this spell. It conjures a sword of pure wild magic that unerringly strikes the designated target and inflicts 1D8 damage. On impact, the sword also produces one of the following random effects:
- 2D8 points of damage
- 4D8 points of damage
- Paralysis for 2D4 rounds if a save vs. spell is failed, 1D3 rounds if saving throw is successful

Starting from level 12, the warlord gains better control over the spell and can influence the chaotic magic that drives the sword to add more violent or other elemental random effects:
- 6D8 points of fire damage
- 8D8 points of cold damage
- Dispel Magic (no saving throw)
- Flesh to Stone on a failed save vs. petrification at -2, otherwise paralysis for 2D4 rounds
- 10D8 points of electricity damage.~
@73161 = ~Ghost Hit (Evocation)
Level: 3
Range: 20 meters
Duration: instantaneous/special
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: special

The search for an unstoppable hit led the warlord to create this spell. It conjures a sword of pure wild magic that unerringly strikes the designated target and inflicts 1D8 damage. On impact, the sword also produces one of the following random effects:
- 2D8 points of damage
- 4D8 points of damage
- Paralysis for 2D4 rounds if a save vs. spell is failed, 1D3 rounds if saving throw is successful
- 6D8 points of fire damage
- 8D8 points of cold damage
- Dispel Magic (no saving throw)
- Flesh to Stone on a failed save vs. petrification at -2, otherwise paralysis for 2D4 rounds
- 10D8 points of electricity damage.~

@7317 = ~Elemental Resistance~
@7318 = ~Elemental Resistance (Abjuration)
Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the warlord to better resist fire and cold. When he casts the spell, he must choose against which element he wishes to resist, then he gains 4% per level (max 80%) of resistance against that element, whether magical or natural: spells, weapons, wands, breath weapons, etc.
From level 8, the warlord can also choose protection against electricity.
From level 11, he may also choose protection against acid.
This spell can be cast multiple times to combine protection against different elements, but not several times for the same element.~
