Saving Throw: none

This spell allows the warlord to better resist fire, cold, electricity and acid. When he casts the spell, he must choose against which element he wishes to resist, after which he gains 80% of resistance against that element, whether magical or natural: spells, weapons, wands, breath weapons, etc.
This spell can be cast multiple times to combine protection against different elements, but not several times for the same element.~
