@7319 = ~Intuition~
@7320 = ~Intuition (Divination)
Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

This spell helps the warlord anticipate dangers that might befall him. While protected by this spell, he gains a general bonus of +1 to Armor Class and saving throws vs. breath weapon, and cannot be hit by a backstab.~
