@7321 = ~Iron Tornado~
@7322 = ~Iron Tornado (Enchantment)
Level: 3
Range: 0
Duration: 10 seconds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

The warlord discovered this imperfect but highly effective spell while seeking to strike faster. It greatly accelerates the caster's movements for a short period of time, allowing him to get 10 attacks per round for 10 seconds. The spell does not accelerate his mind to match, making his movements clumsy and imposing a -5 penalty to THAC0 and 50% chance of spell failure. Experience gradually overcomes this drawback: the attack penalty decreases by 1 and the spell failure chance by 10% every 4 caster levels beyond level 5 (-1 to THAC0 and 10% chance of spell failure at level 21).~
